-4986-926e-3b5d7f9cfb04", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Global teamwork", "children": [{"id": "eb7d52a8-be69-4a62-a98d-725b5f9d91d4", "type": "concept", "title": "Virtual collaboration, meeting norms, and decision-making"}, {"id": "b8a0416b-42bc-4dd7-9f74-96ac7e5246a4", "type": "concept", "title": "Psychological safety and inclusion"}, {"id": "4200f943-ee4d-46f3-a7f3-c49d759d3800", "type": "concept", "title": "Role clarity, feedback, and conflict escalation"}], "description": "Students learn how teams coordinate across language, time zone, hierarchy, and norms."}, {"id": "0da4bcfe-5223-410d-9341-bcf1bdb643a4", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Leadership and management", "children": [{"id": "e68cade7-a60c-4395-9b2e-3b5910010337", "type": "concept", "title": "Authority, participation, feedback, and accountability"}, {"id": "a1c4f1eb-56a6-4720-9447-ab818d4f8b10", "type": "concept", "title": "Motivation, trust, and relationship-building"}, {"id": "8bb1aae6-abf5-4da7-a314-08ca469437a3", "type": "concept", "title": "Inclusive leadership and cultural humility"}], "description": "Leadership expectations vary across cultures and institutions."}, {"id": "553f3209-7e99-415b-9ee5-91a59c21e6ae", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Negotiation and client communication", "children": [{"id": "16bb435e-541d-4ba2-9c06-de15534f9cb2", "type": "concept", "title": "Relationship versus task orientation"}, {"id": "5a84d6d6-98eb-40af-a7a8-3e50099744f1", "type": "concept", "title": "Directness, silence, concessions, and time horizons"}, {"id": "4dd2fea1-74f8-4817-a81a-adaa60e0657a", "type": "concept", "title": "Ethical persuasion, contracts, and mutual understanding"}], "description": "Students practice adapting negotiation strategies without stereotyping counterparts."}]}, {"id": "41eb33c3-feca-4440-b293-fb4cd9e32735", "type": "topic", "title": "Ethical Representation, Cultural Appropriation, Advocacy, and Public Communication", "description": "Students learn ethical decision-making for representing